ication and the Verifier/Gate ancestry check: this guard reduces avoidable stale publication but cannot eliminate later races. Add no scheduler, retry loop, dependency, new role, or Kernel code.\\n\\nEvidence: collision revision 34b04b06de58ebfe735dedd977b00c2a614cc752 passed checks but was stale because 73d1489 landed during implementation. Local Fixer policy digest 4d7e25ef73d3dad94e08d461a7347a6c4cde500e195c81bd3d60d4c547671c32 was exercised by Run 1788552644310643252-fixer: it refetched, verified ancestry, and published 3af7c062e632f0677f6ef4db399188ffd8484267 with original rejected-SHA CAS.\\n\\nAcceptance: reviewable minimal role-policy diff on current primary; supported forest declaration show loads both declarations without errors; repository checks pass; exact request/verdict/Gate evidence integrates the policy. Do not add source-text tests for prompts or claim local runtime hashes prove Git integration.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T20:16:08.947Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-04T20:28:25.63Z\",\n    \"derived\": {\n      \"terminal\": false,\n      \"waiting\": false,\n      \"open\": true,\n      \"live\": true,\n      \"takeable\": false\n    }\n  }\n]\nEXIT:0\n===TAKEABLE===\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"canopy-verifier-current-subject\",\n    \"title\": \"Read current Powder contract and review evidence before verdict publication\",\n    \"spec\": \"Make current Subject feedback an explicit read-only Verifier input in agents/verifier/agent.md. For request tracker=powder, read powder show \\u003csubject\\u003e before reviewing and again immediately before publishing a verdict; require matching repository, current spec, and notes. Reconcile conflicting instructions or reproductions explicitly against behavior rather than silently ignoring or blindly accepting them. If the current Subject contract cannot be read, do not approve. Do not acquire, release, or complete its claim. Preserve exact-revision request provenance, configured check